+// Antidetect: ChromeDriver detection prevention notes
+//
+// ChromeDriver adds several detectable artifacts:
+//
+// 1. $cdc_ variables injected into page DOM
+//    - Solution: Rename the ChromeDriver call function prefix
+//    - Apply: chrome/test/chromedriver/js/call_function.js
+//    - Change: "$cdc_" prefix to a random string per session
+//
+// 2. document.$chrome_asyncScriptInfo
+//    - Solution: Rename to non-detectable name
+//
+// 3. ChromeDriver user-agent modifications
+//    - Solution: Use --antidetect-user-agent to set clean UA
+//
diff --git a/chrome/test/chromedriver/js/call_function.js b/chrome/test/chromedriver/js/call_function.js
